      "summary": "The Windows components catalog, the desktop and emulator packages, the Linux runtime and the Steam seed now live on the organisation's components repository (Droid-Deck/DroidDeck-Components PR: catalogs with rewritten links; releases mirrored, vendor-fetched and built by CI, nothing uploaded by hand). This changes the four catalog URLs the app reads and the test bases; nothing else. Merge after th",
